{"game": "sniper-elite-resistance", "language": "english", "appid": 2169200, "month": "2025-03", "window": 2, "start_date": 1741392000, "end_date": 1742083199, "month_true_total": 211, "quota": 17, "returned": 17, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 09:03:30 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "190308594", "author": {"steamid": "76561198158131134", "personaname": "Chuck71302", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198158131134/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 2305, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1714, "deck_playtime_at_review": 1714, "last_played": 1742340203, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "it isnt some grand masterpiece, more of thesame, but it is fun......also works great on the Deck", "timestamp_created": 1742081461, "timestamp_updated": 1742081461, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "190268163", "author": {"steamid": "76561198017066197", "personaname": "Dabber", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198017066197/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 3220, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3219, "last_played": 1766178118, "avatar": "ead2d45348ded03a68d9f3772fc45a24e86c952c"}, "language": "english", "review": "love it  lots of fun", "timestamp_created": 1742052140, "timestamp_updated": 1764432403, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "190263816", "author": {"steamid": "76561198000416496", "personaname": "RondoR", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/RondoR/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 6895, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1519, "last_played": 1788113859, "avatar": "1c179e4d87109c4d869bf2fe057f18e32c0c68f6"}, "language": "english", "review": "I thoroughly enjoy this franchise--including this game. I normally wait until I get an hour of gameplay for every dollar I paid. In this case, I don't need to wait. I like that the game is mostly the same as previous releases. My only complaint from the last release and this one is that the campaign is too short. I think they need to add more objectives per mission. Overall its still a 5/5.", "timestamp_created": 1742049328, "timestamp_updated": 1742049328, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "190262039", "author": {"steamid": "76561198066807685", "personaname": "Kapitalia19", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198066807685/", "num_games_owned": 47, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 1769, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1251, "last_played": 1754320528, "avatar": "faf38812c88a1c2432f410b07e4ce9481928fe2d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Entertaining game as always", "timestamp_created": 1742048213, "timestamp_updated": 1742048213, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "190233404", "author": {"steamid": "76561198017075981", "personaname": "yodasmith00", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198017075981/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 25414, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 556, "playtime_at_review": 383, "last_played": 1791465365, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "I like it. I have played all the sniper elite games.", "timestamp_created": 1742022958, "timestamp_updated": 1742022958, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "190231395", "author": {"steamid": "76561198062039759", "personaname": "Tagirix", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/tagirix/", "num_games_owned": 424, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 583, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 583, "deck_playtime_at_review": 583, "last_played": 1742019820, "avatar": "41d542aee587d1fab58b4b4442c0735f017be8b6"}, "language": "english", "review": "Being a true fan of this series, I can't really recommend this one to anyone. The problem with Sniper Elite games in general is that Rebellion is trying to make a lot of $ out of it by bombarding games with their games released every 2 years. It is starting to be reminiscent of Ubisoft's Assassin's Creed series. \n\nI guess every con of this game can be more descriptive if you look at the facts and numbers. After finishing the campaign, I was wondering if the multiplayer (which I used to disregard with respects to Sniper Elite series) was any good. I have been unable to find any match... Checked in-game players on Steam and it turns out there were 500 concurrent players (a substantial portion of them are probably playing campaign). I do realize that the multiplayer supports the cross-platform, but it does not seem to help to find a match, since there are no players. \n\nI was stupid to buy Resistance for a sticker price. I'd say it is worth buying, but only it is no sale at 75% off the sticker. Otherwise, should definitely be avoided.", "timestamp_created": 1742020642, "timestamp_updated": 1742020860, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "190224901", "author": {"steamid": "76561199178403549", "personaname": "Krapp Shoot", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199178403549/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 5173, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1886, "last_played": 1779583794, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good", "timestamp_created": 1742013038, "timestamp_updated": 1742013038, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "190207281", "author": {"steamid": "76561198384456108", "personaname": "AceBlacksmith", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/AceTheBlacksmith/", "num_games_owned": 103, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 2245, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2230, "last_played": 1743387936, "avatar": "c73d72d6c459bf9f3e36e6dfe483db3f33954193"}, "language": "english", "review": "->CAMPAIGN<-\nBe sneaky and stealthy -> spend 10 hours learning the spawn locations, studying the patrols/enemy locations, timings and when a weapon will make sound to enemies nearby, hiding bodies/knocked enemies where no-one will go/cant find. (one mission at the time)\n\nOR\n\nHaha there will be no-one to find after mow down everyone with my smg/rifles and machineguns.\n\nSome friends got the game and finished the game faster then i did, bc i go back to missions to retry strats and do it faster and faster.\n\n->Axis Invasion<-\nVERY campaign sided, its fun to try to invade friends and try to sabotage their game. I wish the invasion phones where \"re-worked\". maybe give a more general sence of direction and not the exact last position. Make it easier to pose as regular soldiers. Allow 2 vs 2 campaign mode.\n\n->Multiplayer<-\nHas some fun modes, have not played much of it to give my thoughts.\n\n->Survival<-\nVery fun but can easy be softlock by enemies that dont push forward and are shielded by map boundries. \n\n->Propaganda challanges<-\nFix the \"ghost kill\" mechanic since it's very buggy (as of 15 march - 25)\nMake the sniping challanges more difficult\n\n->Movment and items<-\nThe movment is janky and hard to control, make more of the map vaultible/climbible etc, more map interaction. more items and paths to complete objectives.\n\nI will update this when/if the game is changed. . .", "timestamp_created": 1741993836, "timestamp_updated": 1741994618, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "190191254", "author": {"steamid": "76561197999362601", "personaname": "MORCEGAO-KE", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197999362601/", "num_games_owned": 3477, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 686, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 686, "last_played": 1741823740, "avatar": "8896fe2a855fbb58ff1950e505477baefe5744ca"}, "language": "english", "review": "I cant believe how short is this new campaign is. Even though I didn't rush at all, took less the 8 hours to finish it.  Its was like a DLC from Sniper Elite 5. Not worth the money at all. Missions with 2 or 3 main objectives and 1 or 2 secondary objectives. The small maps feel empty, NPCs no challenge. Same boring environment. Doesn't matter if you have the DLC  or not you  wont have a sniper with a supressor to start.  To unlock the attachments for your guns you need to do boring objectives. Its so annoying. Rebellion we are not stupid, give us a Vietnam war in the jungle with real stealth missions. I'm a pve guy, I hate pvp. I bought this game only to play campaign with my friend and what a waste of money.", "timestamp_created": 1741979553, "timestamp_updated": 1741979553, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.558575272560119629", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 21, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "190180627", "author": {"steamid": "76561198063016239", "personaname": "andrewjgeorge4", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198063016239/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 5216, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 177, "playtime_at_review": 1136, "last_played": 1790451860, "avatar": "dd896c06dffa9879d7e6ee1e00eedd8b762eb850"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fantastic\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1741970859, "timestamp_updated": 1741970859, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "190127816", "author": {"steamid": "76561199693031415", "personaname": "Agent-Doctor™", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199693031415/", "num_games_owned": 151, "num_reviews": 86, "playtime_forever": 16385, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8431, "last_played": 1780256367, "avatar": "65eaa417202765ec87f3a3f3b01c834ccc55f67d"}, "language": "english", "review": "just as good as 5", "timestamp_created": 1741910798, "timestamp_updated": 1741910798, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "190122181", "author": {"steamid": "76561198112860458", "personaname": "EmperorLemon", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ziggydabigboi/", "num_games_owned": 585, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 1304, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 30, "last_played": 1777680298, "avatar": "3d288a6c0e639a5d18426c213580c04648c73a54"}, "language": "english", "review": "Nothing original or different and the Main Voice Actor is terrible i thing ive given up on this series also stop putting DLC in every game which revolves around killing Hitler, Talk about milking a dead horse", "timestamp_created": 1741904424, "timestamp_updated": 1741904424, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "190113116", "author": {"steamid": "76561198067252576", "personaname": "Boognoss", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198067252576/", "num_games_owned": 1017, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 3561, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2535, "deck_playtime_at_review": 1232, "last_played": 1750556144, "avatar": "525b471c6da3514d9212fdc9dcde1d6f9aca1e09"}, "language": "english", "review": "Yes it’s more of the same as SE5 but I like the gameplay loop and more is better. I’ve only played single-player and invasion has never appealed. Probably a bit expensive at release for what you get but more testicle shots can’t be a bad thing. Recommended but perhaps wait until it’s discounted.", "timestamp_created": 1741895432, "timestamp_updated": 1741895432, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "190097863", "author": {"steamid": "76561198007508010", "personaname": "RazorEddie", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198007508010/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 18118, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8591, "last_played": 1787407605, "avatar": "2fa0e5300c272052f073b7650a8643ae5230d2f1"}, "language": "english", "review": "The Propaganda campaigns, particularly the pistol challenges are rubbish. What is the point of having a time limit? The overall campaigns are too simple. the maps unremarkable and hence too boring. More annoying is the reuse of buildings taken from SE5 and in some cases even using SE5 maps both in Survival and Team Play in Multiplayer!!! Overall, the game has the feel of being aimed at much younger audiences. I am going back to SE5, a far superior product.", "timestamp_created": 1741881617, "timestamp_updated": 1741881617, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "190088788", "author": {"steamid": "76561198068348433", "personaname": "Jason Sharpe", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198068348433/", "num_games_owned": 618, "num_reviews": 284, "playtime_forever": 2088, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1562, "last_played": 1742539284, "avatar": "d600758c59cf36314077eb44237ac05b41d5e55c"}, "language": "english", "review": "It constantly crashes for me. It won't run on my rig sadly. Buy it though!", "timestamp_created": 1741873299, "timestamp_updated": 1742304430, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "190057513", "author": {"steamid": "76561198083383090", "personaname": "JuniorLaws", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/JuniorLaws/", "num_games_owned": 120, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 1135, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 200, "last_played": 1743359108, "avatar": "27e35fea5b00971c5c4119fc76c6a9f77be43549"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun game. Love the Axis Invasion mode it adds a twist to the game play. Having to fight through the Axis to complete objectives while there is an enemy sniper on the lose that you can either kill or avoid if possible.", "timestamp_created": 1741826885, "timestamp_updated": 1741826885, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.47999998927116394", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": true, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "190055951", "author": {"steamid": "76561198314762451", "personaname": "warfare1944", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198314762451/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 93, "playtime_forever": 765, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 739, "last_played": 1742669935, "avatar": "8df3fbb9717a9433d4c709138700c25228676cb9"}, "language": "english", "review": "As someone who loved invading on SE5, this game is such a disappointment. 90% of the matches I joined were either at the mission end when everything was already done, or the person just ended it the second I joined. One match I was paired with a cheater and didn't have time to report him due to him ending the match and the game booting me off the report feature.", "timestamp_created": 1741824835, "timestamp_updated": 1741824835, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}]}